      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "In the policy configuration window, configure the required properties using which changes must be detected:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 6
    },
    {
      "item": "Users",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "To detect changes based on user properties, select Users and follow these steps:",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          56
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select Enabled and click Save.",
      "depth": 2,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          7,
          14
        ],
        [
          25,
          29
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
